# 4. Core Product Flow

## 1. Entry

User opens Telegram bot → `/start`

## 2. Onboarding

* select English level
* minimal profile creation

## 3. Rooms

* user selects a themed room
* receives Telegram invite link

## 4. Conversation

* user joins Telegram voice chat (group-based)

## 5. Post-session

* user clicks “Finished talking”
* sends voice message

## 6. AI Pipeline

1. voice → file download
2. Whisper → transcript
3. GPT → analysis
4. store result
5. send feedback

---

